	  [SPIES:REMOTE-HOOK]    per-call logic: filter / rewrite / block
	  [SPIES:DIRECT-HOOK]    remote.FireServer(remote, ...) form
	  [SPIES:CLOSURE-HOOK]   Closure Spy wrapper
	  [SPIES:HYDROXIDE]      scanner modes
	  [SPIES:HOOKSPY-WRAPPER] Hook Spy wrappers
	  [SPIES:META-HOOKS]     Metatable tab hooks
	  [SPIES:HTTP] / [SPIES:ORIGINALS]  Originals tab loader + script list
	  [SPIES:TABS]           tab list
	  [SPIES:UTOPIA]         UtopiaSpy settings (blacklistedNames, maxTableDepth, ...)
	  [SPIES:UTOPIA-CODEGEN] UtopiaSpy code generator (get_path / get_real_value / convert_to_code)
	  [SPIES:UTOPIA-CLIENTINVOKE] OnClientInvoke logging
	  [SPIES:UTOPIA-SRC]     embedded original UtopiaSpy script (Originals tab)
]]

-- Common Locals
